{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":72503,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793446810145,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"episodeCount":12,"posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1331436","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"中学二年生の坂井知季は、水泳の飛び込みに励む毎日。始めたきっかけは幼い頃に見た３つ年上の富士谷要一の美しい飛び込みに魅了されたこと。友人の陵、レイジとともにミズキダイビングクラブ・通称MDCに通う知季だったが、ある日MDCに謎の女性・麻木夏陽子が現れ...？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-07-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o3a9AUN6vqys1X0piUr8kdJVUPR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o3a9AUN6vqys1X0piUr8kdJVUPR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72503/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"1336840","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"オリンピック出場...夏陽子が告げたMDC存続への条件はあまりにも大きなものだった。新しくコーチとなった彼女の徹底した指導に戸惑う一同だが、知季は与えられた練習を必死にこなしていく。そしてまた新たに、一人の青年がMDCへ訪れる――。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-07-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9JBCtF4MQntDVs155YWQv6ByCGa.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9JBCtF4MQntDVs155YWQv6ByCGa.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72503/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"1337718","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"夏陽子が連れてきたのは、津軽の海で育った青年・沖津飛沫。要一の完璧な飛び込みとは真逆をいく、彼のダイナミックな飛び込みにMDCの一同は圧倒される。そんなある日、知季は夏陽子から「三回半」を７月の選考会で飛ぶよう命じられて...？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-07-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/OXWLUnyuT9p267E6uX98Dz753M.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/OXWLUnyuT9p267E6uX98Dz753M.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72503/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"1339651","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ゴールデンウィークに入り、強豪選手との合同練習が始まった！要一を宿敵とし、何かと張り合う山田・通称ピンキーをはじめとする個性的なメンバーが一同に揃う。普段とは違うレベルの高い環境での練習に嬉々として臨む知季だが――。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-07-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72503/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"1339652","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"知季に対する夏陽子の指導に贔屓を感じた陵とレイジ。いままで仲の良かった２人の態度の変化に落ち込む知季。そんな様子を見かねた要一が、帰り際の知季を呼び止めて――。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-08-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72503/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"1339653","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"彼女を弟に奪われたショックから立ち直れない知季。選考会が迫るもMDCに現れない知季にしびれを切らした夏陽子は、知季が生まれ持ったダイバーとしてのある才能の存在を告げる。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-08-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72503/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"1339654","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"4位という選考会の結果に、知季はこれまで感じたことのない悔しさがこみ上げる。一方、試合で腰のケガが発覚した飛沫。そして振るわない結果に終わった陵。それぞれが決意を胸に、新たな道を歩み始める。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-08-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72503/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"1339655","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"置き手紙を残し、津軽へ戻った飛沫。彼女の恭子や家族との一時を過ごすのもつかの間、北京合宿から帰ってきた知季と要一が突然やってくる。いつもの練習とは違った余暇楽しむ３人だったが、飛沫は夏陽子から預かってきたという一枚のDVDを渡されて...？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-08-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"ht